OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry start
OL,6,Fto the evening, but a band of rain,
OL,7,Fheavy and thundery in places, will
OL,8,Fmove northwards throughout the night.
OL,9,FA warm and muggy night to come.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA wet start to the day, but
OL,12,Fdrier and brighter conditions will
OL,13,Fmove in from the south throughout the
OL,14,Fmorning. A few afternoon showers
OL,15,Fpossible but most will be dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
